# @recoup/dunningkit-core — environment template
#
# The offline core needs NO keys. All 203 tests, `npm run self-test`, and the
# standalone ledger verifier run fully offline and deterministic (see README).
# Copy to `.env` only if you opt into the live Gemini adapter.
#
#   cp .env.example .env

# ── Google Gemini (OPTIONAL — offline path never reads this) ──────────────────
# Only read by src/core/intent/gemini.ts, which is lazy-constructed and used
# solely when GEMINI_API_KEY is set. The 203-test suite and the simulator never
# import it, so leaving this unset keeps every proof artifact network-free.
# Get from: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-key-here
